---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about The Orange Desk's mission, publishing standards, and the team behind our fact-checked guides on money, technology, and everyday decisions."
>
  <div class="container-page py-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About' }]} />
  </div>

  <section class="container-page pb-16">
    <div class="prose prose-orange lg:prose-lg mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1>About The Orange Desk</h1>
      <p>
        The Orange Desk was founded in 2024 with one goal: to publish guides on money, technology, and everyday
        decisions that readers can actually trust, written by people who put their name on the work.
      </p>

      <h2>Our mission</h2>
      <p>
        Search results are crowded with content written to rank rather than to help. We built The Orange Desk
        as the opposite: every article starts from a real question a reader is trying to answer, and we don't
        publish it until we're confident the answer holds up.
      </p>

      <h2>How we're different</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Every article has a named author with a visible bio and credentials.</li>
        <li>Every piece is reviewed by a second editor before it goes live.</li>
        <li>We date every article and update it when the underlying facts change.</li>
        <li>We disclose our editorial process in full on our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy page</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        We're a small, independent publishing team. You can meet every writer, editor, and fact-checker on our
        <a href="/editorial-team/">editorial team page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Where we're based</h2>
      <p>
        The Orange Desk is operated from Mumbai, Maharashtra, India. You can reach us any time through our
        <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
